
dock load
  load <global:response>, name response-runtime

# the response shim parses a json body through the stdlib json runtime, so it rides along
dock load
  load <global:json>, name json

load @term/seed/code/network/http
  find response

task read
  take response, like response
  take format, like text, fall text <text>
  like unknown

  fork case, read format
    case text
      send back
        call response-runtime/text
          read response/dock
    case bytes
      send back
        call response-runtime/bytes
          read response/dock
    case json
      send back
        call response-runtime/json-body
          read response/dock

